_\\alpha $</span> satisfy <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$|\\Rm |&lt;\\alpha /t&#x27;\\le 2Q$\">$|\\Rm |&lt;\\alpha /t&#x27;\\le 2Q$</span>. For points in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$M_\\alpha $\">$M_\\alpha $</span>, use (<a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FKleinerLott%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fpart-i%23I.%2810.2%29\" data-tex-node=\"references/KleinerLott/blueprint/src/chapters/part-i#I.(10.2)\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-492e2831302e3229\">122</a>). Lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FKleinerLott%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fpart-i%23distancedist\" data-tex-node=\"references/KleinerLott/blueprint/src/chapters/part-i#distancedist\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-64697374616e636564697374\">106</a> with <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$r_0=AQ^{-1/2}/100$\">$r_0=AQ^{-1/2}/100$</span> gives </p><p><span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-33322e34\"></span><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{equation}  d_{t&#x27;}(x_0,x&#x27;)-d_{\\bar t}(x_0,x&#x27;)\\le \\tfrac 12\\alpha Q^{-1}2(n-1)\\left({2\\over 3}4Q{AQ^{-1/2}\\over 100}+{100Q^{1/2}\\over A}\\right). \\end{equation}\">\\begin{equation}  d_{t&#x27;}(x_0,x&#x27;)-d_{\\bar t}(x_0,x&#x27;)\\le \\tfrac 12\\alpha Q^{-1}2(n-1)\\left({2\\over 3}4Q{AQ^{-1/2}\\over 100}+{100Q^{1/2}\\over A}\\right). \\end{equation}</span></p><p> For large <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$A$\">$A$</span> this is at most <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$AQ^{-1/2}/2$\">$AQ^{-1/2}/2$</span>, proving (<a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FKleinerLott%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fpart-i%23I.%2810.1a%29\" data-tex-node=\"references/KleinerLott/blueprint/src/chapters/part-i#I.(10.1a)\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-492e2831302e316129\">124</a>). </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</spa